return {
    ["1. <Highlight>家族申请表：</>每位未加入家族的非凡者可填写发布个人申请表寻找适合自己的家族，申请表在发布<Highlight>3天后</>或成功加入家族后将会自动撤下。\n2. <Highlight>响应招募：</>未加入家族的非凡者，可选择自行发起或加入其他非凡者的响应招募，发起响应的非凡者默认成为<Highlight>家族首席</>。\n3. <Highlight>创建家族：</>在响应招募阶段中，家族的响应人数达到<Highlight>3人及以上</>，即可创建家族，创建过程中首席可以调整家族名称和成员位次。\n4. <Highlight>加入家族：</>当家族成员不满<Highlight>14人</>时，首席可发起家族招募。其他非凡者发起申请，并通过首席审核后，可直接加入家族。"] = "1. <Highlight>Family Application Form:</> Every Beyonder who has not joined a Family can fill out and publish a personal application form to find a suitable Family. The application form will be automatically removed <Highlight>3 days</> after publication or once you have successfully joined a Family.\n2. <Highlight>Respond to Recruitment:</> Beyonders who have not joined a Family can choose to initiate or join other Beyonders' recruitment responses. The Beyonder who initiates the response becomes the <Highlight>Family Chief</> by default.\n3. <Highlight>Create a Family:</> During the recruitment response phase, once the number of respondents for the Family reaches <Highlight>3 or more</>, the Family can be created. During the creation process, the Chief can adjust the Family name and member positions.\n4. <Highlight>Join a Family:</> When a Family has fewer than <Highlight>14 members</>, the Chief can initiate Family recruitment. Other Beyonders can submit applications, and after passing the Chief's review, they can join the Family directly.",
