    ["致%s：\n      不必灰心，成长路上总是会出现像密修会小丑这样的强敌，只要没人因此牺牲，一切都还来得及。教会的档案中，对密修会有不少记载，或许能帮到你：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302102\">密修会小丑的记载</>\n      相信身边的队友，在充满疯狂的非凡道路上，他们是你足以信赖的后背，而你也要尽早成长起来，成为一名出色的值夜者。 不过也别那么有压力，我看得出，你有很多特别之处，就像是曾经的我，只是需要一些小小的方式激发出来。教会这里有一套非常适合你的方案，有助于实力的快速提升，我一并附在信末了，记得查阅。\n      去吧，新时代的主角，我看好你。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查阅</>"] = "To %s: \n Do not be discouraged. Strong enemies like the Clown of the Rose School of Thought will always appear on the path of growth. As long as no one sacrifices themselves because of this, everything is still in time. There are many records of the Rose School of Thought in the Church's archives, which might help you: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302102\">Records of the Clown of the Rose School of Thought</>\n Trust your teammates. On the path of the Extraordinary filled with madness, they are the backs you can rely on, and you also need to grow up as soon as possible to become an outstanding Nighthawk. But don't be under so much pressure. I can see that you have many special qualities, just like the old me, you just need some small ways to stimulate them. The Church has a plan that is very suitable for you, which will help you improve your strength quickly. I have attached it to the end of the letter, remember to check it. \n Go, protagonist of the new era, I believe in you. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view</>",
